#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:2
msgid "Mattermost Cloud data residency"
msgstr "OKR.BEST Cloud 데이터 레지던시"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:4
msgid ""
"Mattermost Cloud resides in the ``aws-us-east-1`` region, located in "
"Virginia, United States. The following customer data will be stored at "
"rest in this data center when using Mattermost Cloud:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST Cloud는 미국 버지니아에 위치한 ``aws-us-east-1`` 리전에 있습니다. OKR.BEST "
"Cloud를 사용할 때 다음 고객 데이터는 이 데이터 센터에 저장 상태로 보관됩니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:6
msgid "Channels, messages, replies, and channel membership information"
msgstr "채널, 메시지, 답글, 채널 구성원 정보"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:7
msgid "Collaborative playbooks and event runs"
msgstr "협업 플레이북 및 이벤트 실행"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:8
msgid "User accounts and profiles"
msgstr "사용자 계정 및 프로필"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:9
msgid "Files (e.g., images, docs, etc.) uploaded to the Mattermost Service"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서비스에 업로드된 파일(예: 이미지, 문서 등)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:10
msgid "Plugin, app- or bot-generated messages and files"
msgstr "플러그인, 앱 또는 봇이 생성한 메시지와 파일"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:11
msgid "Data used to measure user count, usage, and revenue"
msgstr "사용자 수, 사용량, 수익을 측정하는 데 사용되는 데이터"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:12
msgid ""
"Data used for analytics and to measure quality of service, e.g., "
"sanitized logs"
msgstr ""
"분석 및 서비스 품질 측정에 사용되는 데이터(예: 정리된 로그)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:13
msgid "IDs generated by Mattermost on behalf of the customer"
msgstr "고객을 대신해 OKR.BEST가 생성한 ID"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/manage/cloud-data-residency.rst:15
msgid ""
"If you require your data to reside in an area outside of the United "
"States, talk to a `Mattermost Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`_, or consider `deploying one of our self-hosted options "
"<https://mattermost.com/download/>`_ that provides full control of your "
"data. You may also work with `one of our partners "
"<https://mattermost.com/partners>`_ for deploying and hosting your "
"Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
"데이터를 미국 외 지역에 보관해야 하는 경우 `Mattermost 전문가 <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`_\\ 와 상담하거나, 데이터를 완전히 제어할 수 있는 `셀프 호스팅 옵션 중 하나 배포 "
"<https://mattermost.com/download/>`_\\ 를 고려하세요. OKR.BEST 서버 배포 및 호스팅을 위해 "
"`파트너 중 한 곳 <https://mattermost.com/partners>`_\\ 과 협력할 수도 있습니다."
